<title>BRAZIL: CVRD bids specs seen out next week-Kandir.</title>
<headline>CVRD bids specs seen out next week-Kandir.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government next week will publish the tender documents for the privatization of state mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce, said Planning Minister Antonio Kandir.  </p>
<p>The first stage of Vale's privatization will begin in April, he said, speaking at a seminar on private savings.</p>
<p>In the period 1997-1998, President Fernando Henrique Cardoso's government plans to privatize $25 billion in state assets, Kandir said.</p>
<p>In 1997, Kandir expects to privatize at least $10 billion in assets.</p>
<p>((--Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485418))</p>
